Article 3 (Composition)
(1) The Committee shall consist of nine members, including one chairperson and one vice-chairperson.
(2) The First Vice Minister of Finance and Economy shall serve as chairperson, and the Director General of the Tax Office of the Ministry of Finance and Economy shall serve as vice-chairperson.
(3) The following persons shall be members of the Committee:
1. The Assistant Minister of Finance and Economy;
2. The Director General of the Treasury Office of the Ministry of Finance and Economy;
3. The Director General of the Future Strategy Planning Office of the Ministry of Planning and Budget;
4. The Director General of the Budget Office of the Ministry of Planning and Budget;
5. The Vice Commissioner of the National Tax Service;
6. The Vice Commissioner of the Korea Customs Service;
7. A policy officer belonging to the Senior Executive Service of the Ministry of Finance and Economy who assists with the overall coordination of tax policy.
(4) The Committee shall have one secretary-member to support its work, who shall be the member referred to in paragraph (3) 7.
